  "name": "Baystation12",
  "description": "Baystation12 is a mature, roleplay-oriented fork of the Space Station 13 simulation engine, leveraging the Dream Maker language to facilitate complex player interactions and environmental systems. It incorporates sophisticated subsystems for atmospheric dynamics, advanced medical procedures, and chemistry, supported by a diverse toolset including Python bots, Java-based asset managers, and C++ network extensions. The repository serves as a foundational platform for high-stakes multiplayer narratives within the BYOND ecosystem.",
